{
  "$comment": "One stored performance-event-v1 line. Structural constraints only: the canonical Go validator in perfdata (DecodeEvent) additionally enforces canonical byte form (json.Marshal field order, no duplicate keys, no trailing data), the 8192-byte line bound, id = source-e<epoch>-s<seq>, cross-field measurement rules (inclusive CPU = own + descendant when all are measured; counts never exceeding their attempts; GraphQL point states accounting for every attempt; bins summing to count), the attempt identity on attempt events and a correction naming an earlier event of the same source. Normative text: spec/performance-event-v1.md.",
